{"abstract":"In this paper, we explore the qualities of sharing biometric data in re- al-time between athletes, in order to increase two motivational factors for gym- goers: Enjoyment and social interaction. We present a novel smartphone appli- cation, called Race By Hearts, which enables competition based on heart rate data sharing between users in real-time. Through an empirical study conducted in the gym, we show that sharing biometric data in real-time can strengthen so- cial relations between participants, increase motivation, and improve the en- joyment of the fitness activity. Nevertheless, we found that introducing compe- tition based on real-time sharing of biometric data can cause exasperation and discouragement for some athletes. Based on our findings from the study, we discuss how technology can facilitate and modify competition in fitness exer- cises in general.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Sonne, Tobias","Jensen, Mads Møller"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-201896"],"event":{"acronym":"ICEC(ENTER)","end":"2014-10-03","place":"Sydney, au","start":"2014-10-01","title":"IFIP International Conference on Entertainment Computing","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"race by hearts","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-662-45212-7_16","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-201896","identifier":[{"id":"84921415800","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-7ed26386-f6a1-4269-9589-430a5901366b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-65E7A835FF2D8F69C98B2266536F0A9B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://d